{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__dsh-tool-json#card-zh","repo":"omdsh-dev/dsh-tool-json","commit":"ab8933e71e16da2c6ed6e5618b9baf9b1f113484","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH JSON 查询工具（DSH 插件，适用于 DSH 工具调用）：为 Agent 提供按路径读取 JSON 数据的能力。它通过 DSH 的 tools 注册名为 json 的工具，接收 JSON 对象或 JSON 字符串以及路径表达式，并返回匹配值。主要功能包括点号访问嵌套属性、方括号数组索引、带引号的特殊属性名访问，以及针对数组的通配符投影；还会检查输入结构并对查询长度、深度和投影规模设限。适合需要从 API 响应、配置或工具输出中提取字段的 DSH 用户。使用时不需要额外 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:18-48","src/query.ts:15-18","src/query.ts:286-312"]}
{"unit_id":"omdsh-dev__dsh-tool-json#card-en","repo":"omdsh-dev/dsh-tool-json","commit":"ab8933e71e16da2c6ed6e5618b9baf9b1f113484","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH JSON Query is a tool for reading structured JSON values by path. It supports nested properties, array indexes, quoted keys, and wildcard projection over arrays, returning the matched value to the agent. Use it to extract fields from JSON inputs. It needs no API key or external service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:18-48","src/query.ts:15-18","src/query.ts:286-312"]}
